    <h1>Oma's Meatloaf</h1>
    <p class="recipe-intro">
      Oma's blend of pork and beef meatloaf.
    </p>

    <div class="meta-row">
      <div><span class="label">Prep</span>10 min</div>
      <div><span class="label">Bake</span>1 hour</div>
      <div><span class="label">Makes</span>1 loaf</div>
    </div>

    <h2>Ingredients</h2>
    <ul class="ingredients">
      <li>500 g ground pork</li>
      <li>500 g ground beef</li>
      <li>2 eggs, well beaten</li>
      <li>1/2 cup bread crumbs</li>
      <li>onion, chopped</li>
      <li>salt and pepper, to taste</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Steps</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>Combine all ingredients in a large bowl.</li>
      <li>Mix until combined.</li>
      <li>Put in a well-greased loaf pan.</li>
      <li>Cook at 450°F for 1 hour (1/2 hour per pound).</li>
    </ol>

    <div class="notes">
      <strong>Notes:</strong> Serve with mashed potatoes and side vegetables (corn, carrots, peas, beans, etc.)
    </div>

